# Token Rotation Audit Log
# Format: timestamp,token_type,environment,performed_by,status,preview
#
# SECURITY: This file should be kept secure and access-restricted
# RETENTION: Keep for 7 years minimum for compliance
# LOCATION: Store in secure location (not public git repository)
#
# Token Types: JWT_SECRET, RAILWAY_API_TOKEN, DATABASE_URL, SMTP_PASSWORD
# Environments: staging, production
# Status: success, rolled_back, failed
# Preview: Last 8 characters of new credential (for identification, not full value)
#
# Example entries (DO NOT use these in production):
# 2024-01-15 14:30:00,JWT_SECRET,production,john.doe@example.com,success,...X7D9kL2p
# 2024-01-15 14:45:00,RAILWAY_API_TOKEN,production,jane.smith@example.com,success,...rtf_xyz789
# 2024-02-03 09:15:00,JWT_SECRET,production,security-team@example.com,success,...9rT5yU2i
# 2024-03-20 02:00:00,DATABASE_URL,production,dba-team@example.com,success,...db_new
# 2024-03-20 03:30:00,SMTP_PASSWORD,staging,devops@example.com,rolled_back,***
#
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BEGIN AUDIT LOG
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
